OL,3,GNEWSARadical change needed to cut
OL,4,AScottish child poverty, says charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland is on course to miss
OL,7,Flegally-binding targets to cut child
OL,8,Fpoverty "by a wide margin", according
OL,9,Fto a report from a leading social
OL,10,Freform charity.
OL,12,FThe Joseph Rowntree Foundation (JRF)
OL,13,Fsaid one in five children was in
OL,14,Fpoverty and "radical change" was needed
OL,15,Fto put the Scottish government's
OL,16,Fpledges back on track.
OL,18,FIt urged ministers to craft a "much
OL,19,Fbolder and properly-funded plan to
OL,20,Freduce poverty" by rewiring local
OL,21,Fgovernment, public services and the tax
OL,22,Fsystem.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
