OL,3,GNEWSARadical change needed to cut
OL,4,AScottish child poverty, says charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish government said it had
OL,7,Fmade great strides, with its policies
OL,8,Fkeeping 100,000 children out of poverty
OL,9,Fthis year, but accepted there was more
OL,10,Fto do.
